 from the upper sky, its blade-like wings unfolding into a stable flight configuration. Blue energy lines illuminate across its armor, and the triangular chest reactor gradually becomes brighter. Powerful blue-white thrusters ignite behind its wings and feet, pushing clouds and atmospheric haze outward.\n\nThe camera smoothly follows the mecha as it accelerates over the lake toward the enormous circular structure at the center of the city. Its body leans forward naturally during flight while the wings make small mechanical adjustments to maintain balance. The mecha performs a controlled turn between the monumental towers, then slows above the central plaza. Strong downward thrusters create expanding ripples across the lake, bend nearby trees and lift dust from the plaza.\n\nThe mecha lands firmly in front of the central circular structure, one knee briefly lowered and one hand touching the ground. A restrained circular shockwave spreads through dust and mist without destroying the surrounding architecture. It rises into a powerful upright stance and looks toward the gigantic circular gateway while its blue chest reactor pulses once. Maintain one consistent mecha design throughout the entire video. No transformation, no duplicated robot, no additional giant characters, no split screen, no collage, no white background, no building deformation and no city destruction.\n\nCinematic science-fiction realism, monumental scale, stable mechanical anatomy, detailed metallic reflections, realistic flight physics, volumetric sunlight, atmospheric haze, controlled high-speed motion, smooth continuous camera movement, one uninterrupted shot.\n\nAudio: deep mechanical movement, layered servo sounds, powerful blue-energy thrusters, rushing wind during flight, a heavy metallic landing impact, a restrained low-frequency shockwave, distant city ambience and grand futuristic orchestral music, no dialogue."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "t